I've left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to grant more. The fetch would also send each item's untrusted feed text to an external host while the node's output stayed the same, so the side effect would be hidden from the graph. If the graph is updated to grant `http-client`, that change can be made then.

